<title>CANADA: Shaw completes C$350 mln debt placement.</title>
<headline>Shaw completes C$350 mln debt placement.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shaw Communications Inc said on Friday it completed a private placement of debt securities which was expected to garner C$350 million in net proceeds for the company.</p>
<p>Shaw said the issue size was increased to the completed level from an orginal value of C$128 million.</p>
<p>It said the structured transaction involved a delayed takedown feature with Shaw expecting to receive most of the funds in March 1997.</p>
<p>The effective average rate of interest will be 7.54 percent, Shaw said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
